+token sequence match: true
+
+Operational role:
+semantic.k's init rule executes the function body by placing #eval(E, X |-> V)
+in <result>. The #eval rules map the exact AST operations to #add, #multiply,
+and #count; those helpers implement append, repeat, and integer occurrence
+count. #solutionProgram only expands to E before that execution. #byLength
+occurs as the destination summary and expands to the same helper expression;
+it never rewrites <k> or an invocation. Neither verification rule is an
+OPERATIONAL_RULE, PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA, or DOMAIN_LEMMA.
